 3. Other happenings 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 Screenshot of David Ellison's X post announcing the name change. Screenshot: @ellisonskydance /X

 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 🎬 The combined Paramount-Warner Bros. Discovery company will be named Skydance with the ticker SKYD. The name pays tribute to David Ellison's two-decades-old production company which merged with Paramount last year. ( Axios )

 🏛️ The DOJ said it won't reopen its criminal investigation into former Fed chair Jerome Powell over the central bank's costly headquarters renovation. ( Axios )

 ✈️ Boeing 's previously reported 737 MAX software glitch doesn't pose a flight-safety issue, an FAA panel found, removing a barrier to certification for Boeing's final variant of its bestselling 737. ( WSJ )

 🤖 Jay Clayton, the U.S. director of national intelligence, is expected to be tapped for an additional role as the White House's AI czar. ( Axios )

 
 
